    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >TONK is a multiplayer tank game, either played with friends or using the server browser, playing different modes to unlock more and more tanks, upgrading them throughout the rounds to create crazy combinations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Contains:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >over 40 unlockable tanks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 unique game modes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various challenge missions to unlock the fan favourite tanks</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >TONK is a multiplayer tank game, either played with friends or using the server browser, playing different modes to unlock more and more tanks, upgrading them throughout the rounds to create crazy combinations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Contains:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >over 40 unlockable tanks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 unique game modes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various challenge missions to unlock the fan favourite tanks</p></li></ul>",
